<title>HONG KONG: Far East Aluminium posts interim net loss.</title>
<headline>Far East Aluminium posts interim net loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.28 loss  vs 2.41 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	  vs 1.51 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    15.91 loss vs 7.23 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     125.79     vs 177.83</p>
<p>    Company name		 Far East Aluminium (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Far East Aluminium is a curtain wall and aluminium works contractor.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
